# Unsplash returns 401 to every non-browser user agent, so the photo-credit
# links in README.md fail the link check even though they resolve fine in a
# browser (verified: 307 redirect with a normal browser UA).
https://unsplash\.com/photos/.*

# Cybernews sits behind Cloudflare bot management, which serves an "Attention
# Required! | Cloudflare" interstitial with a 403 to every automated client --
# the whole host does this, including the homepage, and no amount of browser
# headers gets past it (verified: 403 with a full Chrome UA and header set).
https://cybernews\.com/.*

# LinkedIn answers non-browser clients with HTTP 999, its standard
# anti-scraping status, so the speaker's profile link in every deck fails the
# check while loading fine in a browser (verified: 999 with a normal browser
# UA, which is a block rather than a missing page).
https://www\.linkedin\.com/.*
